{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["Of their carcasses you shall not touch — at the time that you need to touch consecrated things or eat consecrated things, as it is written: כל הנוגע בהם יקדש — he must sanctify himself. Also with service vessels, also with the altar, also with the flesh of a hattat — in all of them it is written: כל הנוגע בהם יקדש — he must sanctify and purify himself first, so that if he touched a carcass or any other impurity written in the Torah, he must sanctify and purify and immerse himself first before his touching consecrated things."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:35.326692762Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}